 "director": {
  "mode": "hand",
  "notes": "42 is merged in because 43 «مهطعين» continues its sentence; 43-52 is one unit in the recitation. The Day, the staring eyes, the changed earth, the chains, the tar and the fire are never drawn: night and geometry only, with an hourglass for «إنما يؤخرهم ليوم» and geometric on His names. No plate on «وأنذر» or «فلا تحسبن» (the Prophet ﷺ addressed). Not glossed where the tafsirs differ: 46:1-3 (who plotted), 46:7-12 («وإن كان مكرهم لتزول منه الجبال»), 48:1-6 (the change of the earth), 51:7-10. The disbelievers' plea (44:9-17) is not restated. A book for «هذا بلاغ للناس»."
 },
